libuio NEWS                                    -*- outline -*-

* Noteworthy changes in release 0.4.0 (2026-10-23)

** New features

  libuio: Add uio_free_info() to the public API.

** Bug fixes

  Fix multiple memory leaks (thanks to Github's modbw)

** Changes in behavior

  libuio: If you already use the uio_free_info() function previously not
  publically declared in the API header, and you manually free the info
  struct map names, you need to stop doing so to avoid a double free.
  Similarly, if you already use that function the info struct map names are
  now correctly freed and you must not use them any more after freeing the
  info struct.

* Noteworthy changes in release 0.3.0 (2024-03-07)

  Baseline. For earlier changes see the git history.
